  "description": "<p>The University of Hull is a research university located in the northern port city of Hull.</p><p>The university ranks 60th in the UK in the 2021 Times and Sunday Times University Rankings and has a TEF Silver Award.</p><p>It offers a range of courses in both the arts, humanities and sciences, and has an especially strong reputation for its Medical School and Business School.</p>",
